@startuml Component_Architecture
title MDA <-> MDH Integration -- Component Diagram

package "MDA (existing project, read-only here)" {
  [UML Activity Diagram\n(poisson_dsc.uml)] as UML
  [ATL Transform\n(poisson_uml2cuda.atl)] as ATL
  [Acceleo-generated naive kernel\n(poisson_mda_original.cu)] as MDA_KERNEL
}

package "Bridge (new work)" {
  [UML -> MDH Bridge\n(uml_to_mdh_bridge.py)] as BRIDGE
  [MDH Spec\n(poisson_from_uml.cpp)] as SPEC
}

package "MDH (existing framework, copied in)" {
  [MDH Framework\n(cuda_generator.hpp)] as MDH_GEN
  [MDH-tuned kernel\n(poisson_1.cu)] as MDH_KERNEL
}

package "Benchmark (new work)" {
  [Serial CPU Jacobi] as SERIAL
  [3-way Convergence Harness] as HARNESS
}

[RESULTS.md] as RESULTS

UML --> BRIDGE : parsed by
ATL ..> UML : reads\n(reference only,\nnot executed here)
note right of ATL
  Kept only so the bridge's
  recognized vocabulary can be
  checked against what MDA's
  own transform already hardcodes.
end note

BRIDGE --> SPEC : emits
SPEC --> MDH_GEN : compiled & run by
MDH_GEN --> MDH_KERNEL : generates

MDA_KERNEL --> HARNESS : benchmarked in
MDH_KERNEL --> HARNESS : benchmarked in
SERIAL --> HARNESS : baseline for
HARNESS --> RESULTS : reports speedup table

@enduml

@startuml Pipeline_Activity
title UML -> MDH Bridge -- Activity Diagram (how it runs)

start
:Author UML activity diagram in Papyrus\n(SelectNode, CheckBounds, BoundsDecision,\nReadNeighbours, ApplyStencil, StoreValue);
:Bridge parses poisson_dsc.uml\nand looks for the recognized node pattern;

if (all required nodes present\nwith the expected xmi:type?) then (yes)
  :Map SelectNode -> L(1), L(2);
  :Map ReadNeighbours (top/bot/left/right)\n-> 5-point stencil neighborhood;
  :Map ApplyStencil formula -> scalar_function f;
  :Map StoreValue, no reduce loop -> result_buffer, md_hom<2,0>;
  :Emit generated/poisson_from_uml.cpp;
  :cmake && make -> build/poisson_from_uml;
  :Run executable -> poisson_1.cu, poisson_2.cu;
  :Compile benchmarks (nvcc) with matching tile -D flags;
  :Run Serial Jacobi (CPU) to convergence;
  :Run MDH-tuned kernel (GPU) to convergence;
  :Run MDA naive kernel (GPU) to convergence,\nsame serial baseline, same harness;
  :Compare iteration counts, residuals,\nmax diff, and kernel times;
  :Record 3-way speedup table in RESULTS.md;
else (no)
  :Abort with a clear error --\nthe bridge refuses to guess silently;
  end
endif
stop

@enduml
